          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Medium importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;研究聚焦&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;硅-膨胀石墨复合负极&lt;/strong&gt;在充放电过程中界面不稳定、硅体积变化显著以及循环性能受限等问题，通过&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;固体电解质界面膜工程&lt;/strong&gt;进行调控。结果显示，优化后的界面可改善该复合材料的电化学表现，为高能量密度锂离子电池负极设计提供思路。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2352152X26030665?dgcid=rss_sd_all&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;Integrating experiments, Monte Carlo sensitivity, computational analysis, and machine learning for predictive optimization of high-pressure hydrogen adsorption in clay minerals&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; J. Energy Storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Medium importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;研究针对黏土矿物在高压条件下的储氢吸附预测与优化问题，综合实验、&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;蒙特卡洛敏感性分析&lt;/strong&gt;、计算分析和&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;机器学习&lt;/strong&gt;建立预测框架。该方法用于识别影响氢吸附的关键因素并优化吸附性能，为地下或矿物介质储氢系统的材料筛选和参数设计提供数据驱动工具。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2352152X26031865?dgcid=rss_sd_all&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;Two-dimensional VN: a high-performance alkali metal anode with ultrafast electron and ion transport&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; J. Energy Storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Medium importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;研究评估&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;二维氮化钒（VN）&lt;/strong&gt;作为碱金属电池负极材料的潜力，重点分析其电子传输和离子迁移特性。研究表明二维VN具有超快电子与离子输运能力，可作为高性能碱金属负极候选材料，为快速充放电储能器件提供新的材料选择。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #64748b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.06645&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;BatteryMat: a hierarchical machine-learning and DFT framework for average-voltage screening of lithium-ion cathode materials&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; arXiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Low importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;该研究面向锂离子电池正极材料的大规模平均电压筛选，提出&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;BatteryMat三级框架&lt;/strong&gt;，以&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;ALIGNN&lt;/strong&gt;快速排序候选结构，再通过&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;ALIGNN-FF脱锂曲线和自动化DFT计算&lt;/strong&gt;逐级验证。ALIGNN在7610个力场标签上的平均绝对误差为0.17 V，DFT层对四种商业正极材料的平均电压预测与实验值相差不超过0.3 V，并从&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;JARVIS-DFT和Alexandria&lt;/strong&gt;数据库中分别筛出71个和213个待进一步验证的候选材料。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #64748b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S266714172600087X?dgcid=rss_sd_all&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;Interlayer engineering regulated high Li-ion diffusion kinetics of layered materials for fast charging batteries&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; eScience&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Low importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;该研究针对层状电极材料中锂离子扩散缓慢、制约电池快速充电的问题，采用&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;层间工程&lt;/strong&gt;调控材料结构与离子传输通道。研究表明，优化层间环境能够提升&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;锂离子扩散动力学&lt;/strong&gt;，为开发高倍率快充电池电极提供材料设计思路。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #64748b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2667141726000030?dgcid=rss_sd_all&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;Machine learning-guided deep eutectic electrolytes for high energy density and safe lithium–air batteries&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; eScience&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Low importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;该研究面向锂空气电池能量密度、安全性与电解液稳定性难以兼顾的问题，利用&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;机器学习&lt;/strong&gt;指导&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;深共熔电解液&lt;/strong&gt;的筛选和设计。所提出的电解液策略旨在同时支持高能量密度与更安全的电池运行，展示了数据驱动方法加速先进电解液研发的潜力。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #64748b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2211285526004623?dgcid=rss_sd_all&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;Machine learning-aided high-temperature polymer composites for capacitive energy storage&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; Nano Energy&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Low importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;该研究针对聚合物介电材料在高温下储能性能易衰减的问题，借助&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;机器学习&lt;/strong&gt;辅助设计和优化&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;高温聚合物复合材料&lt;/strong&gt;。其结果表明，数据驱动的材料开发可用于提升复合材料的高温电容储能能力，为高温功率电子与电容储能器件提供候选方案。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #64748b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2211285526004672?dgcid=rss_sd_all&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;A superionic oxychloride redox catholyte enables high-energy and long-life all-solid-state lithium batteries&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; Nano Energy&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Low importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;该研究聚焦全固态锂电池在能量密度、离子传输与循环寿命方面的瓶颈，提出具有超离子导电特性的&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;氧氯化物氧化还原正极电解质&lt;/strong&gt;。该材料兼顾快速离子传输和氧化还原储能功能，使全固态锂电池实现高能量与长寿命，为&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;活性电极—电解质一体化设计&lt;/strong&gt;提供了新路径。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #64748b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://chemrxiv.org/doi/full/10.26434/chemrxiv.15005871/v1?af=R&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;Machine Learning Prediction of Ionic Conductivity in Solid-State Electrolytes Using Compositional, Structural, and Neural Potential Features&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; ChemRxiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Low importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;该研究针对高离子电导率固态电解质依赖低效实验筛选的问题，构建了融合&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;成分、晶体结构和神经网络势特征&lt;/strong&gt;的机器学习预测流程。该方法用于预测&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;固态电解质的离子电导率&lt;/strong&gt;，可缩小候选材料搜索空间并加快下一代固态锂电池电解质的发现。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #64748b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2542529326001458?dgcid=rss_sd_all&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;Emergence of a frustrated configuration in Li&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;YCl&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt; solid electrolyte: An Active Learning approach&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; Mater. Today Phys.&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Low importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;该研究针对固态电池电解质&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;Li&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;YCl&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;中的复杂原子构型与稳定性问题，采用&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;主动学习方法&lt;/strong&gt;探索其构型空间。结果揭示了材料中受挫构型的涌现，为理解固态电解质的结构行为及优化其储能应用性能提供了微观依据。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #64748b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2542435126002230?dgcid=rss_sd_all&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;Contact loss in all-solid-state Li-ion batteries via deposition of impurities&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; Joule&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Low importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;该研究考察全固态锂离子电池中&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;杂质沉积引发的界面接触损失&lt;/strong&gt;，聚焦这一过程对电极—固态电解质有效接触的破坏机制。研究将杂质沉积与接触退化联系起来，为提高全固态电池的循环稳定性、界面可靠性和制造纯度控制提供了依据。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #64748b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2542435126002254?dgcid=rss_sd_all&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;Reconciling triple-phase boundaries and tortuosity in high-energy all-solid-state lithium-sulfur batteries&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; Joule&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Low importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;该研究针对高能量全固态锂硫电池中&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;三相边界与传输路径曲折度&lt;/strong&gt;之间的设计矛盾，分析复合电极微结构对反应界面和物质传输的共同影响。工作强调需要协调可用三相反应边界与较低曲折度，为优化固态锂硫电池电极结构和提升能量利用效率提供了设计思路。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;

      &lt;article style=&quot;margin-bottom:13px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #64748b;border-radius:13px;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:720;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.03823&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color:#9a3412;text-decoration:none;&quot;&gt;Janus MgAlB&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; MBene: a dipole-engineered anode for ultrafast Li-ion transport and exceptional lithium storage&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:11px;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#334155;&quot;&gt;Journal:&lt;/strong&gt; arXiv&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin:0 7px 5px 0;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff7ed;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#9a3412;&quot;&gt;Matched direction:&lt;/strong&gt; energy storage&lt;/span&gt;
          &lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Low importance&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;p lang=&quot;zh-CN&quot; style=&quot;margin:0;color:#334155;font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;该研究面向高倍率、高容量锂离子储能电极设计，利用第一性原理计算研究具有面外永久极化的&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;Janus MgAlB&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;二维MBene负极&lt;/strong&gt;，并分析其稳定性、锂吸附和扩散机制。极化调控使其锂扩散势垒低至&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;17.1 meV&lt;/strong&gt;，可稳定容纳两层锂，实现&lt;strong style=&quot;color:#0f172a;&quot;&gt;1470.24 mAh/g&lt;/strong&gt;的理论比容量且最大体积膨胀仅3.7%，表明内禀偶极工程能够同时改善锂存储的动力学与热力学性能。&lt;/p&gt;
      &lt;/article&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;/main&gt;

